<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: auto;">
  <h2 style="color: #4a90e2;">Shift Assignment Notification</h2>

  <p>Dear {{userName}},</p>

  <p>You have been assigned a shift in <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>. Below are the details:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Shift Code:</strong> {{shiftCode}}</li>
    <li><strong>Start Date:</strong> {{startDate}}</li>
    {{#if endDate}}
    <li><strong>End Date:</strong> {{endDate}}</li>
    {{/if}}
    <li><strong>Status:</strong> {{status}}</li>
    <li><strong>Weekends:</strong> {{weekendDays}}</li>
  </ul>

  <p>If you have any concerns, please contact your HR/Admin team.</p>

  <p>Best regards,<br/>{{companyName}} Team</p>
  <hr style="margin: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee;" />
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777;">This is an automated notification from the Zuno HR system.</p>
</div>
